ter, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes! Team up with your friends against AI or choose to fight in PvP!\n\n**Build your mage:** Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build. \n\n**Harness the elements:** Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks. \n\n**Grow in Power:** Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.\n\n**Choose Your Battle Mode:** Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.", "short_description": "Crystal Conquest is a free-to-play VR game where you control the elements and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/s/MYSTIC-INTERACTIVE-PRIVACY-POLICY.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Mystic Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/KV9f2dwTdY", "website_url": "https://www.crystalconquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "25649479581303286"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1566552014526318"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1765526400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28528554853395730", "version": "1.1.0"}, "id": "25740082985581976", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28528554853395730"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788084942, "id": "28535368449381037", "version": "1.1.1", "version_code": 64, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28528554853395730"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "Patch 1.1.0 Notes \n\nNew Features\n- Added in game announcements!\n- You can now cast most spells while holding a weapon! Some spells require slamming your hammer on the ground or shooting an arrow\n- Major bot improvements (dodging, blocking, dashing/teleporting, healing, fleeing, guardian movement, etc...)\n- Boulders can now be launched with any Geomancer weapon!\n\nBalancing Changes:\n- Crystal lockout timers no longer increase past 30 seconds\n- Adjusted bot difficulty in Conquest and lowered it for multiplayer matches\n- Lowered Geomancer damage by ~10%\n- Reduced ring upgrade costs\n- Reduced Vacuum Burst's silence duration to 3 seconds\n- Removed two hand mana cost penalty when a spell or weapon in one hand is fully charged\n- Reduced levels of some of the bots in the last two levels of Gauntlet\n- Reduced the amount of homing for most projectiles\n- Reduced the damage of super golems\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements:\n- Fixed various issues with bot hand positioning and twisting\n- Removed spell cast delays on various spells like the Boulder in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed a bow issues where the string could get stuck or the secondary arrow mode would always activate\n- Improved weapon throwing accuracy\n- Improved spell hit and block accuracy at high latency\n- Prevented players from damaging guardians when outside their attack range\n- Fixed a crash that could happen while using weapons in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed issues with golem aiming and golems getting stuck\n- Fixed an issue which caused the barrier spell to shift position rapidly\n- Some spell effects no longer make long streaks when spawning in multiplayer matches\n- Spell menu changes: Spell menu spells are no longer restricted to one hand\n- Many minor fixes\n\nHotfix 1:\n- Fixed issue which could prevent players from joining a multiplayer match when playing a single player mode\n\nMinor Update 1:\n- Added Kickstarter announcement poster!", "created_date": 1788030196, "id": "28528554853395730", "version": "1.1.0", "version_code": 63, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28528554853395730"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "Patch 1.1.0 Notes \n\nNew Features\n- Added in game announcements!\n- You can now cast most spells while holding a weapon! Some spells require slamming your hammer on the ground or shooting an arrow\n- Major bot improvements (dodging, blocking, dashing/teleporting, healing, fleeing, guardian movement, etc...)\n- Boulders can now be launched with any Geomancer weapon!\n\nBalancing Changes:\n- Crystal lockout timers no longer increase past 30 seconds\n- Adjusted bot difficulty in Conquest and lowered it for multiplayer matches\n- Lowered Geomancer damage by ~10%\n- Reduced ring upgrade costs\n- Reduced Vacuum Burst's silence duration to 3 seconds\n- Removed two hand mana cost penalty when a spell or weapon in one hand is fully charged\n- Reduced levels of some of the bots in the last two levels of Gauntlet\n- Reduced the amount of homing for most projectiles\n- Reduced the damage of super golems\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements:\n- Fixed various issues with bot hand positioning and twisting\n- Removed spell cast delays on various spells like the Boulder in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed a bow issues where the string could get stuck or the secondary arrow mode would always activate\n- Improved weapon throwing accuracy\n- Improved spell hit and block accuracy at high latency\n- Prevented players from damaging guardians when outside their attack range\n- Fixed a crash that could happen while using weapons in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed issues with golem aiming and golems getting stuck\n- Fixed an issue which caused the barrier spell to shift position rapidly\n- Some spell effects no longer make long streaks when spawning in multiplayer matches\n- Spell menu changes: Spell menu spells are no longer restricted to one hand\n- Many minor fixes\n\nHotfix 1:\n- Fixed issue which could prevent players from joining a multiplayer match when playing a single player mode", "created_date": 1786224542, "id": "28264131066504778", "version": "1.1.0", "version_code": 62, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28528554853395730"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "Patch 1.1.0 Notes\n\nNew Features:\n- Added in game announcements!\n- You can now cast most spells while holding a weapon! Some spells require slamming your hammer on the ground or shooting an arrow\n- Major bot improvements (dodging, blocking, dashing/teleporting, healing, fleeing, guardian movement, etc...)\n- Boulders can now be launched with any Geomancer weapon!\n\nBalancing Changes:\n- Crystal lockout timers no longer increase past 30 seconds\n- Adjusted bot difficulty in Conquest and lowered it for multiplayer matches\n- Lowered Geomancer damage by ~10%\n- Reduced ring upgrade costs\n- Reduced Vacuum Burst's silence duration to 3 seconds\n- Removed two hand mana cost penalty when a spell or weapon in one hand is fully charged\n- Reduced levels of some of the bots in the last two levels of Gauntlet\n- Reduced the amount of homing for most projectiles\n- Reduced the damage of super golems\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements:\n- Fixed various issues with bot hand positioning and twisting\n- Removed spell cast delays on various spells like the Boulder in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed a bow issues where the string could get stuck or the secondary arrow mode would always activate\n- Improved weapon throwing accuracy\n- Improved spell hit and block accuracy at high latency\n- Prevented players from damaging guardians when outside their attack range\n- Fixed a crash that could happen while using weapons in multiplayer matches\n- Fixed issues with golem aiming and golems getting stuck\n- Fixed an issue which caused the barrier spell to shift position rapidly\n- Some spell effects no longer make long streaks when spawning in multiplayer matches\n- Spell menu changes: Spell menu spells are no longer restricted to one hand\n- Many minor fixes", "created_date": 1786211160, "id": "28262370666680818", "version": "1.1.0", "version_code": 61, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28528554853395730"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785557076, "id": "28169724345945451", "version": "1.0.16", "version_code": 60, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}